WEBVTT

00:01:21.623 --> 00:01:23.425
Machina...

00:01:23.425 --> 00:01:26.292
Pleasure to meet you, Akira-chan.

00:01:46.147 --> 00:01:51.853
Osanai hi ni nakushita

00:01:51.853 --> 00:01:57.759
sono itami no imi sae

00:01:57.759 --> 00:02:03.498
Uzumakumatte takushita

00:02:03.498 --> 00:02:06.695
Boku wa kitto...

00:02:08.103 --> 00:02:14.442
Ao no hate ni mita yokan wo toraete

00:02:14.442 --> 00:02:21.983
kaze ni nori hikari no sasu hou e

00:02:21.983 --> 00:02:24.853
I'll always be with you

00:02:24.853 --> 00:02:27.455
see the sky in front of you

00:02:27.455 --> 00:02:31.824
fly high in a light from the deepest blue

00:02:33.528 --> 00:02:39.000
Uzumaku hoshi no hibiki ni nosete

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.669
utau yo

00:02:41.669 --> 00:02:50.338
Kono koe ga kimi ni todokimasu you ni

00:03:02.690 --> 00:03:06.161
Although we ran into some armed
interference from the Girouard Force,

00:03:06.161 --> 00:03:10.365
we carried out our mission to
capture the Album in one piece.

00:03:10.365 --> 00:03:14.202
That wretched Garnet got
so carried away with herself...

00:03:14.202 --> 00:03:20.041
The Girouard Force is already
roundly protesting this incident.

00:03:20.041 --> 00:03:24.879
They're looking into sanctions,
including dissolving our contract.

00:03:24.879 --> 00:03:29.951
Next, regarding Tachibana
Kazuki and Kamishina Jin...

00:03:29.951 --> 00:03:32.720
Tachibana Kazuki is at the medical center,

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:36.124
being reevaluated for
his fitness as a Dragonaut.

00:03:36.124 --> 00:03:39.694
Kamishina Jin is being
confined inside the base.

00:03:39.694 --> 00:03:42.464
Kamishina Jin, huh?

00:03:42.464 --> 00:03:48.937
That boy is the main culprit behind
all of this, isn't he, Sakaki-kun?

00:03:48.937 --> 00:03:51.906
Kamishina Jin...

00:03:51.906 --> 00:03:56.277
With that quick-witted judgment
and bold initiative he showed

00:03:56.277 --> 00:03:59.914
during atmospheric reentry,

00:03:59.914 --> 00:04:04.819
I would say that he is
indeed Eiji-san's own son.

00:04:04.819 --> 00:04:07.088
What's the matter? Continue your report.

00:04:07.088 --> 00:04:09.090
Yes, please excuse me.

00:04:09.090 --> 00:04:13.595
Next, regarding the captured
Dragon, the Album is currently

00:04:13.595 --> 00:04:16.598
being confined to the special
Dragon ward on base,

00:04:16.598 --> 00:04:20.001
to collect research data
on Original Dragons.

00:04:20.001 --> 00:04:25.273
Finally, Gio and Widow are
being quarantined on Tartarus.

00:04:25.273 --> 00:04:30.411
There's no telling when those
two Dragons will start rampaging.

00:04:30.411 --> 00:04:33.014
It would be proper to dispose
of them as defective goods

00:04:33.014 --> 00:04:37.252
before they cause any more trouble.

00:04:37.252 --> 00:04:41.022
Gio and Widow weren't
bound by Resonance,

00:04:41.022 --> 00:04:44.526
and took up Communication with
people other than their Masters.

00:04:44.526 --> 00:04:46.995
They are plenty valuable
as research subjects.

00:04:46.995 --> 00:04:50.863
Could you please wait a little while
longer before disposing of them?

00:04:52.300 --> 00:04:54.802
The Album alone will be sufficient.

00:04:54.802 --> 00:04:59.340
Isn't it obvious that the more
research subjects we have, the better?

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:04.345
Like I said before, it's too greedy
to try to obtain everything.

00:05:04.345 --> 00:05:05.947
But...

00:05:05.947 --> 00:05:08.049
Cut it out already, will you?!

00:05:08.049 --> 00:05:12.187
Would you mind not talking about
defective goods, research subjects,

00:05:12.187 --> 00:05:16.055
and disposing of Dragons in front
of Machina and the others?

00:05:20.195 --> 00:05:22.026
Akira-chan...

00:05:25.466 --> 00:05:27.569
My report is over.

00:05:27.569 --> 00:05:29.871
- Good work.
- Take it easy.

00:05:29.871 --> 00:05:34.365
Otherwise, I'll have you reevaluated
for your fitness as a Dragonaut, too.

00:05:46.721 --> 00:05:51.059
I was once told something by Howling Star.

00:05:51.059 --> 00:05:54.429
The destiny of earthborn Dragons,
hatched through Resonance,

00:05:54.429 --> 00:05:56.731
is to protect their Masters.

00:05:56.731 --> 00:06:01.369
I have already lost my Master,

00:06:01.369 --> 00:06:03.838
but you still have yours.

00:06:03.838 --> 00:06:05.106
Tachibana Kazuki?

00:06:05.106 --> 00:06:08.543
Kazuki is your Master.

00:06:08.543 --> 00:06:11.112
He isn't my Master.

00:06:11.112 --> 00:06:15.883
So, is my destiny to be
Tachibana Kazuki's Dragon, after all?

00:06:15.883 --> 00:06:20.255
Destinies cannot be
changed, but fates can be.

00:06:20.255 --> 00:06:22.590
But that's only if you're still alive.

00:06:22.590 --> 00:06:25.059
What do you mean?

00:06:25.059 --> 00:06:30.965
This island is a Dragon disposal ground.

00:06:30.965 --> 00:06:33.868
It is a top-secret ISDA facility,

00:06:33.868 --> 00:06:36.971
where Dragons that are judged
to be unfit for whatever reason

00:06:36.971 --> 00:06:42.210
are secretly disposed of,
and buried deep under the ground.

00:06:42.210 --> 00:06:47.148
If we have been brought
here, then it means...

00:06:47.148 --> 00:06:51.953
There is a CSS electromagnetic
shield surrounding this island.

00:06:51.953 --> 00:06:56.447
It is impossible for us
Dragons to leave here.

00:06:58.960 --> 00:07:01.496
Screw those guys!

00:07:01.496 --> 00:07:04.294
What do they take us for?!

00:07:10.772 --> 00:07:13.741
Brother, hurry up!

00:07:13.741 --> 00:07:15.902
I'll be right there!

00:07:19.614 --> 00:07:23.418
Ai?! Dad?! Mom?!

00:07:23.418 --> 00:07:25.079
Jin...

00:07:27.822 --> 00:07:29.414
Toa...

00:07:33.294 --> 00:07:37.165
I'm the one who made you all alone.

00:07:37.165 --> 00:07:41.202
That's why I appeared.

00:07:41.202 --> 00:07:43.102
Toa...

00:07:48.609 --> 00:07:50.645
Hey, you people!

00:07:50.645 --> 00:07:52.980
Let me out of here! Let me go see Toa!

00:07:52.980 --> 00:07:55.850
That all depends on your attitude.

00:07:55.850 --> 00:08:01.982
Kitajima Yuri, head of the research
team here, Kamishina Jin-kun.

00:08:07.328 --> 00:08:09.297
What is he doing?

00:08:09.297 --> 00:08:12.834
This is Resonance.

00:08:12.834 --> 00:08:15.703
Resonance? This?

00:08:15.703 --> 00:08:19.741
Resonance is a communion
between man and Dragon.

00:08:19.741 --> 00:08:23.244
You could call it a contract. Now,

00:08:23.244 --> 00:08:27.882
Communicators are born from
eggs that undergo Resonance.

00:08:27.882 --> 00:08:29.317
Gio!

00:08:29.317 --> 00:08:30.818
The person who goes through Resonance

00:08:30.818 --> 00:08:34.088
becomes that Dragon's Master,
and that Dragon is under

00:08:34.088 --> 00:08:37.024
absolute obedience to
their Master's orders.

00:08:37.024 --> 00:08:39.356
Absolute obedience?

00:08:40.895 --> 00:08:44.599
As you can see, Gio's Master
is Tachibana Kazuki.

00:08:44.599 --> 00:08:47.268
But as you know, following this,

00:08:47.268 --> 00:08:52.940
Gio did not choose Tachibana Kazuki,
but you, Kamishina Jin-kun.

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:55.067
This is extremely fascinating.

00:08:56.744 --> 00:08:58.446
What do you want me to say?!

00:08:58.446 --> 00:09:00.748
What's even more interesting

00:09:00.748 --> 00:09:03.239
is the relationship
between you and the Album.

00:09:05.052 --> 00:09:07.188
You mean, Toa is also someone else's...

00:09:07.188 --> 00:09:10.792
Someone else?
You're the only one, aren't you?

00:09:10.792 --> 00:09:14.929
Me? That can't be! After all, I never...

00:09:14.929 --> 00:09:17.298
I didn't go through Resonance with Toa!

00:09:17.298 --> 00:09:21.436
There is evidence in your body
that you went through Resonance

00:09:21.436 --> 00:09:24.739
with the Album two years ago,
during the shuttle accident.

00:09:24.739 --> 00:09:27.141
Me?

00:09:27.141 --> 00:09:28.972
And Toa?

00:09:30.711 --> 00:09:32.079
Yes.

00:09:32.079 --> 00:09:35.983
So you see, the Album
that you are chasing after...

00:09:35.983 --> 00:09:39.976
You are her Master.

00:09:49.063 --> 00:09:51.224
Man, am I beat.

00:09:56.437 --> 00:10:00.737
Seems like I don't
understand things anymore.

00:10:10.084 --> 00:10:12.453
What am I supposed to believe?

00:10:12.453 --> 00:10:14.689
Here.

00:10:14.689 --> 00:10:18.359
Akira-chan, I peeled it for you.

00:10:18.359 --> 00:10:21.260
Oh, thank you.

00:10:22.463 --> 00:10:24.999
Akira!

00:10:24.999 --> 00:10:27.991
What are you so laid-back for?

00:10:31.272 --> 00:10:33.174
At a time like this, too.

00:10:33.174 --> 00:10:34.869
Here.

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:38.713
Apple-bunnies, are they?

00:10:38.713 --> 00:10:41.482
Outstanding.

00:10:41.482 --> 00:10:43.313
I mean, nothing.

00:10:45.019 --> 00:10:47.855
Mr. Cyril was so adamant about having us

00:10:47.855 --> 00:10:52.193
make sure to settle things with the military,

00:10:52.193 --> 00:10:57.164
but it turns out he's been
conned by that Girouard prince.

00:10:57.164 --> 00:10:59.800
Not that I was expecting much.

00:10:59.800 --> 00:11:02.203
You're unusually chatty, huh?

00:11:02.203 --> 00:11:03.871
What does that mean?

00:11:03.871 --> 00:11:08.175
You didn't really come here
to talk about that, right?

00:11:08.175 --> 00:11:09.836
Spill it.

00:11:17.084 --> 00:11:22.488
Please, don't betray us, or anything.

00:11:24.992 --> 00:11:30.698
Amagi is dead, Kazuki is useless,
and Jin is out of the question.

00:11:30.698 --> 00:11:34.869
And now, Akira, if you leave,
it'll just be me and Raina,

00:11:34.869 --> 00:11:37.099
and I couldn't bear that!

00:11:38.906 --> 00:11:42.899
Yeah, all right. I promise.

00:11:46.581 --> 00:11:48.572
Hey, Senpai...

00:11:50.084 --> 00:11:55.856
It's almost my birthday.
I sure would like a present.

00:11:55.856 --> 00:11:59.560
What are you, gift-grubbing? That's childish.

00:11:59.560 --> 00:12:01.687
Is that wrong?

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:06.567
Think about what you want.

00:12:06.567 --> 00:12:08.736
All right!

00:12:08.736 --> 00:12:11.364
Nothing too expensive, though.

00:12:19.880 --> 00:12:25.720
Not being able to capture Gio,
I'm truly terribly sorry to ask you

00:12:25.720 --> 00:12:30.925
to accommodate me so
frequently, Prince Asim.

00:12:30.925 --> 00:12:32.950
Never mind about Gio.

00:12:35.763 --> 00:12:37.492
The Album.

00:12:45.072 --> 00:12:47.975
I want the Album.

00:12:47.975 --> 00:12:52.647
Her beauty is truly worthy of me.

00:12:52.647 --> 00:12:57.184
But the Album is already in ISDA custody,

00:12:57.184 --> 00:13:00.154
and I do not believe
she will be easy to obtain.

00:13:00.154 --> 00:13:03.190
Think hard, Garnet.

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:08.184
Why did we have our spies infiltrate ISDA?

00:13:10.698 --> 00:13:13.030
Now is the time, isn't it?

00:13:15.302 --> 00:13:16.860
Yes, sir!

00:13:25.813 --> 00:13:27.948
That is the Album?

00:13:27.948 --> 00:13:30.885
Gio, Widow, and the Album...

00:13:30.885 --> 00:13:36.157
they've all acted in partnership
with someone who wasn't their Master.

00:13:36.157 --> 00:13:38.893
All of these Dragons have
appeared in succession,

00:13:38.893 --> 00:13:41.028
without being bound
by a Resonance contract.

00:13:41.028 --> 00:13:44.156
I'm sure that something is about to change.

00:13:46.367 --> 00:13:51.639
I want to discover what that is.

00:13:51.639 --> 00:13:54.408
What is the Album's condition?

00:13:54.408 --> 00:13:58.145
Pulse and blood pressure are both stable.

00:13:58.145 --> 00:14:00.545
It looks like the sedative is working.

00:14:12.026 --> 00:14:13.594
The Album has escaped!

00:14:13.594 --> 00:14:16.030
Someone, catch her!

00:14:16.030 --> 00:14:19.056
Someone! Someone!

00:14:22.269 --> 00:14:23.571
The Album is fleeing!

00:14:23.571 --> 00:14:26.240
Requesting the special unit to mobilize!

00:14:26.240 --> 00:14:29.844
No way, no way, they don't stand a chance.

00:14:29.844 --> 00:14:34.115
Despite that sweet face
she has, she's a Dragon.

00:14:34.115 --> 00:14:37.118
- Not very discreet, Ryoko.
- Sorry!

00:14:37.118 --> 00:14:40.020
But she is an Original Dragon, right?

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.789
How are we supposed to catch her?

00:14:41.789 --> 00:14:44.291
- Mm-hmm.
- Both of you!

00:14:44.291 --> 00:14:47.260
Right, we'll do our best.

00:15:03.978 --> 00:15:07.948
Say, Akira-chan, are you sure about this?

00:15:07.948 --> 00:15:12.476
No matter what happens,
Akira-chan, I'll stay with you.

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:30.437
You are her Master.

00:15:30.437 --> 00:15:33.240
Me, Toa's Master?

00:15:33.240 --> 00:15:37.945
You're not alone. I'm here, after all.

00:15:37.945 --> 00:15:40.147
How can that be?

00:15:40.147 --> 00:15:43.317
What exactly is Resonance?

00:15:43.317 --> 00:15:44.919
Jin, hurry and get out of here!

00:15:44.919 --> 00:15:47.588
Huh? Why are you?

00:15:47.588 --> 00:15:49.490
Akira-chan, hurry!

00:15:49.490 --> 00:15:51.358
Come on, what are you doing?!

00:15:51.358 --> 00:15:53.127
But, Toa is...

00:15:53.127 --> 00:15:56.964
Toa is getting away on her own!
So you have to get going, too!

00:15:56.964 --> 00:15:58.591
Yeah!

00:16:15.683 --> 00:16:17.518
I've come for you.

00:16:17.518 --> 00:16:19.281
Hold still!

00:16:23.457 --> 00:16:26.794
Wait! I've come to pick these little ones up!

00:16:26.794 --> 00:16:29.463
Pick the little ones up?

00:16:29.463 --> 00:16:31.131
That is my mission.

00:16:31.131 --> 00:16:35.035
Stop! I am in charge here.

00:16:35.035 --> 00:16:39.540
I will not let you lay
one finger on these eggs.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:40.741
You're...

00:16:40.741 --> 00:16:43.403
These eggs are of Earth.

00:16:57.157 --> 00:17:00.752
The parking garage is up ahead.
Let's take a car, and get out of here!

00:17:11.238 --> 00:17:12.506
Raina...

00:17:12.506 --> 00:17:15.676
I knew this would happen, sooner or later.

00:17:15.676 --> 00:17:17.111
You mean...

00:17:17.111 --> 00:17:23.284
Yeah, I know you've given aid
to Kamishina Jin several times.

00:17:23.284 --> 00:17:29.056
Or perhaps you put these
two up to it, Kamishina Jin.

00:17:29.056 --> 00:17:30.751
I...

00:17:33.060 --> 00:17:34.550
Raina!

00:17:35.763 --> 00:17:39.533
No, he didn't. Akira-chan
and I decided on this.

00:17:39.533 --> 00:17:44.305
- Machina!
- Take one step closer,
and I will strangle Raina.

00:17:44.305 --> 00:17:46.273
Stop her, Akira!

00:17:46.273 --> 00:17:47.808
And if I say no?

00:17:47.808 --> 00:17:50.644
Machina, are you serious?!

00:17:50.644 --> 00:17:53.213
Hurry and open your eyes, too, Howl!

00:17:53.213 --> 00:17:55.149
- Raina!
- Stay back!

00:17:55.149 --> 00:17:57.117
I'll be all right.

00:17:58.552 --> 00:18:00.144
Raina!

00:18:07.561 --> 00:18:09.897
These eggs are of Earth.

00:18:09.897 --> 00:18:12.923
Why? Why would you?

00:18:15.636 --> 00:18:17.304
Discontinue the experiment?!

00:18:17.304 --> 00:18:20.908
That's right. Discontinue
the Album experiment.

00:18:20.908 --> 00:18:23.844
But why?! Please give me a reason!

00:18:23.844 --> 00:18:29.249
Why discontinue it?! After we've
finally gotten a live sample?!

00:18:29.249 --> 00:18:32.853
What good will come from examining her?

00:18:32.853 --> 00:18:34.989
What good will come of it? Well...

00:18:34.989 --> 00:18:39.326
I hope you won't get me wrong.
I'm not trying to steal your chance

00:18:39.326 --> 00:18:44.698
at recognition by the scholastic
community out of spite.

00:18:44.698 --> 00:18:47.801
It's just that, haven't you
ever thought that maybe

00:18:47.801 --> 00:18:50.938
mankind would be better off
not discovering some things,

00:18:50.938 --> 00:18:56.777
or that sometimes, it's better
not to know certain things?

00:18:56.777 --> 00:18:59.013
What exactly are you...

00:18:59.013 --> 00:19:00.547
You are outstanding.

00:19:00.547 --> 00:19:04.711
Do not be hasty. Someday,
you will be recognized.

00:19:07.021 --> 00:19:09.623
The experiment suddenly
discontinued like that...

00:19:09.623 --> 00:19:13.460
That's far too high-handed,
even for Professor Nozaki.

00:19:13.460 --> 00:19:15.189
Listen, Senpai...

00:19:16.497 --> 00:19:17.865
To Tartarus?

00:19:17.865 --> 00:19:20.467
They've got the same level
of research facility there

00:19:20.467 --> 00:19:22.636
as they do here, don't they?

00:19:22.636 --> 00:19:26.173
But without permission
from Professor Nozaki...

00:19:26.173 --> 00:19:28.675
You could take the Album
there on your own authority,

00:19:28.675 --> 00:19:31.979
under the pretext of quarantining her,
Senpai, couldn't you?

00:19:31.979 --> 00:19:34.379
I suppose that's true...

00:19:35.716 --> 00:19:39.520
It will be all right. As long
as we get some results,

00:19:39.520 --> 00:19:41.988
even the professor will
give you recognition!

00:19:44.825 --> 00:19:47.350
Let's work through this, Senpai!

00:19:58.005 --> 00:19:59.840
Why are you helping me?

00:19:59.840 --> 00:20:02.543
We think that you might be able
to change the relationship

00:20:02.543 --> 00:20:04.778
between people and Dragons.

00:20:04.778 --> 00:20:06.880
The relationship between
people and Dragons?

00:20:06.880 --> 00:20:10.717
Machina is always there at my side.

00:20:10.717 --> 00:20:16.190
But that's not because she's
absolutely obedient to me, her Master.

00:20:16.190 --> 00:20:23.130
Machina and I are together because
we absolutely need each other.

00:20:23.130 --> 00:20:25.299
Akira-chan...

00:20:25.299 --> 00:20:29.403
Dragons are not the property of humans.

00:20:29.403 --> 00:20:31.572
We share our existences with each other.

00:20:31.572 --> 00:20:35.565
You get that, since you were with Gio,
despite not being his Master.

00:20:58.232 --> 00:21:02.603
Sometimes, it's better not to
know certain things, isn't it?

00:21:02.603 --> 00:21:05.139
Haven't you ever thought that?

00:21:05.139 --> 00:21:06.840
Why would he tell me that now?

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:10.606
Senpai, about my present...

00:21:12.346 --> 00:21:14.248
Picking something up on radar.

00:21:14.248 --> 00:21:17.012
Something is headed
this way at high speed!

00:21:29.163 --> 00:21:33.367
Sonar pattern match! One of the two
is a Girouard Force submarine!

00:21:33.367 --> 00:21:36.302
- The Girouard Force?
- The other one is...

00:21:38.939 --> 00:21:40.770
That's...

00:21:42.876 --> 00:21:45.345
...an Agathion!

00:21:45.345 --> 00:21:48.473
Emergency! This is the ISDA submarine...

00:21:50.551 --> 00:21:54.009
Senpai, I've settled on a birthday present.

00:21:59.159 --> 00:22:01.028
I'll take the Album.

00:22:07.501 --> 00:22:14.174
Me to me ga atta shunkan

00:22:14.174 --> 00:22:20.981
kanashimi ga hajimaru ki ga shita

00:22:20.981 --> 00:22:27.654
Keshite mo kienai kioku ima demo

00:22:27.654 --> 00:22:34.856
futari no kokoro tsunaide'ru

00:22:36.697 --> 00:22:43.537
Ikusen no hoshi no kazu hodo hito wa

00:22:43.537 --> 00:22:46.540
afurete iru no ni ne

00:22:46.540 --> 00:22:50.410
kimi shika mienai

00:22:50.410 --> 00:22:53.580
Aenakute mo

00:22:53.580 --> 00:22:56.516
kanawanakute mo

00:22:56.516 --> 00:23:02.789
tsunoru omoi wa kitto eien

00:23:02.789 --> 00:23:09.796
Unmei ga futari wo hikisaku nara

00:23:09.796 --> 00:23:16.637
deaeta koto dake wo kiseki to shinjite

00:23:16.637 --> 00:23:23.243
Hora nagarete'ku kono ame no you

00:23:23.243 --> 00:23:29.283
Itoshisa dake wo kimi ni furasetai

00:23:29.283 --> 00:23:33.481
Rain of Love

00:23:43.096 --> 00:23:44.298
Next episode preview!

00:23:44.298 --> 00:23:46.600
Still recovering from injuries
received during the intense battle

00:23:46.600 --> 00:23:49.136
at the base of Mt. Fuji, a new foe
appears before the Dragonauts,

00:23:49.136 --> 00:23:51.004
- after they fall into an enemy trap!
- Hey...

00:23:51.004 --> 00:23:53.674
Meanwhile, in Istanbul,
the bomb plot by General Blackeye

00:23:53.674 --> 00:23:55.642
was drawing ever nearer! Second by second,

00:23:55.642 --> 00:23:58.078
- the countdown to detonation approaches!
- Hey, now...

00:23:58.078 --> 00:24:00.447
Next time, on Dragonaut... The Resonance:

00:24:00.447 --> 00:24:02.115
Decisive Battle at 20,000 Meters!

00:24:02.115 --> 00:24:04.084
Roses Blooming in the Solar Wind
Have the Fragrance of Death!

00:24:04.084 --> 00:24:06.853
